  moveName: Stealth Rock
  description: "Throw a stone that stops at the first enemy and leaves a hidden field for up to 60s. Triggering the field reveals it and grants a stacking shield for 3s. The field deals four ticks of damage, slowing by 25% per hit for 2s and immobilizing enemies on their second hit for 1s. The next basic attack is boosted. Stores two uses with 1s between uses, recovering one every 8.5s. Only two fields may exist at once. At level 13, stores three uses."
